cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vorflow, please cite it as below."
title: "vorflow: Voronoi mesh generation for MODFLOW 6"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rui
    family-names: Hugman
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0891-3886"
    affiliation: INTERA Geoscience Pty Ltd
  - given-names: Oscar
    family-names: Sanchez
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rhugman/vorflow"
url: "https://rhugman.github.io/vorflow/"
abstract: >-
  vorflow generates 2D unstructured Voronoi grids for MODFLOW 6 groundwater
  models. It converts a conceptual model of polygons, lines and points into a
  feature-conforming triangular mesh with Gmsh and takes its dual to produce
  Voronoi cells, with local refinement, barriers, structured quad buffers and
  DISV export.
keywords:
  - MODFLOW 6
  - groundwater
  - Voronoi
  - unstructured grid
  - mesh generation
  - Gmsh
